The shaders in this pack are fresh GLSL reimplementations of visual ideas
from Critter & Guitari's EYESY_OS modes (Python + pygame).  No EYESY source
code is copied.  The upstream work is distributed under the 3-clause BSD
licence reproduced below, and this pack carries that notice, its three
conditions and its disclaimer so they travel with the code.

Upstream: https://github.com/critterandguitari/EYESY_OS
Modes:    https://github.com/critterandguitari/EYESY_Modes_OSv3

The HVS-80 project as a whole is GPL-3.0; BSD-3-Clause is GPL-3 compatible,
so these files may be distributed as part of it.  The GLSL in this directory
is (c) 2025 GoatsAndMonkeys and is offered under GPL-3.0 as well as under the
BSD-3-Clause terms below.

